        <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">Current Limitations</h2>
        <ul class="text-muted small">
            <li>Not intended to implement the complete SQL language.</li>
            <li>Only supported SQL expressions and query features can be parsed and validated.</li>
            <li>Function return types require additional metadata for semantic validation.</li>
            <li>Subquery is currently unsupported</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="small">
            For the complete list of supported features and limitations,
            see the <NavLink href="playground#limitations">Query Playground</NavLink>.
        </p>
    </section>
